{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45fe81751ba1547592204ef5aac029e92698000aecae25e79de04318734ab068",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc5ab2860749e809b21fdb33e38295011ca06fda3a1563b4a774bc8b61465d51",
      "text": "打扫事务所即是净化心灵",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8df137f69125ad05bb41b0917366f9d0338d9918e3fb083caecc905e0302dd69",
      "text": "雨彦发现制作人的肩头有脏污，\n便帮忙掸拭干净。制作人觉得肩膀变轻了。\n雨彦开玩笑说也许除了脏污还驱除了别的东西，引得两人发笑。改天，\n两人决定一起打扫事务所……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc5ab2860749e809b21fdb33e38295011ca06fda3a1563b4a774bc8b61465d51",
      "text": "打扫事务所即是净化心灵",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70be1cf46022b22fb69b573f1cc5f919b66fce59287ea5de5e287a7bed0c9b8a",
      "text": "呼……会议总算结束了呢。\n辛苦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:320a4e9701494848a17e48ee7126d288a0564707815e0c124e02a4c744eea78f",
      "text": "啊啊，辛苦啦。今天电视台的工作人员、\n赞助商和制作公司，大家可都讨论得热火朝天啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59f4d40489f330fc8835e1a8985941e4980e88ecc5845b539053bc6939ac9fed",
      "text": "要不是你把大家的话整合好，\n估计还得拖更久吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45cca2bdcb3c2bbc4cc8802229e2d105f576b134b049e3a29c0b828d0e1c0e0c",
      "text": "雨彦先生的提议很切中要害，才是关键所在哦。\n非常感谢。您累了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fad6d7fedeaa816b3268006b323c04cf552011abadaaea8af1cdd6b02fdedca",
      "text": "我倒是没事，不过你……似乎已经累到\n连肩膀上的灰尘都注意不到了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a4171262b53f17eb1eb9e270071166067c30e79a1ee2bcc31ce99c37e5c7e7e",
      "text": "嘛，在那个位置确实看不见吧。\n我来帮你掸掉，稍微站着别动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e45863a31a87796b5867adabed6c2af97450864166a0fd0a19c8cb210ab079b",
      "text": "好嘞，弄掉了。\n变得干干净净的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75b2964bf5191c01233bbc1e27b0b820f7f91149b611f57dc371e705bcae1144",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n呵呵，总觉得肩膀好像变轻了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66d15a96f9fd215fd58a92565c6452bcc9555ccd7faa16b362eb3a1a8e16f473",
      "text": "哈哈，在掸掉灰尘的同时，\n说不定顺便把别的东西也给驱除掉了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:257e1bb2034c4c6475440a3beba688819dde98f643cac54c50a5c86680a842b4",
      "text": "啊哈哈。说不定还真是这样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b92b029320950dc2e86b8ba9c1469a77f54b919d21a1dc16ad97aaae6b03e756",
      "text": "（自从雨彦先生帮我掸掉脏污后，\n肩膀酸痛好像变轻松了……是心理作用吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa156fe3930da59b52c59b65fe96d80894608ff4ad2ab8790be8c151832e999f",
      "text": "哟，早上好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c680f625e784f87b76d613953acaeb892d552b4541e7a9504d21aedffb6bf089",
      "text": "雨彦先生，早上好。……咦？\n已经到Legenders碰头的时间了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a75f46b325f941561e7e0b807a4d1e7b0344de79a34bcdb6c43e35757d14803c",
      "text": "不，离碰头还有一阵子呢。\n我只是突然想来打扫一下事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:708376e51492e0f01a5828fd8a2d473a56d1b4ed075bedbdf49d3cf787c7f8cb",
      "text": "只是稍微早到了点而已。\n借用一下那边的清扫用具啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5105347b66ef83d80aa955046cc40ae82130bad71e3545af5ce70193aee1336e",
      "text": "打扫由我和贤君来做就行了，\n雨彦先生不用挂心也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64d726b04dee1276eae3ca5753db19e70c9930f16b67afe73a42da07c41d848",
      "text": "“怎么能让偶像做打扫呢”，\n咱们事务所可不是那么装腔作势的地方吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09e768b1fd43ccf581074ff71d5f623e1fcc01c941094b2c508eb258be1eaeca",
      "text": "而且，偶尔也让我展现一下\n作为清扫屋的手艺还没生疏嘛？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e2dac55972c7157932a854cccbf5df5fa08a61190ef28205352f9ef20837ab1",
      "text": "呵呵，那么就拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd9b35f84cd83a852cc974878e7fbe3ca3025658821356a5443cc68b1f23a867",
      "text": "谢啦。打扰你工作真不好意思啊。\n在开会之前，我会收拾得干干净净的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a830a1fc5dc1e81d4d36176ad493ab2dc383c552d4ad61eb569096f9a6131579",
      "text": "不，正好我手头的工作也告一段落了，\n我也来帮忙。一起把事务所打扫干净吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:879031e322413c00aa29315afde60293b8a8a14c5ec2f9e516d448d2baa3060b",
      "text": "这种地方最容易被忽略了。\n……嘿咻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3a8bb9a9fe7b1adf1580246deb9a017808e673fd95c4928381c29bbf903bf17",
      "text": "好厉害……\n居然积了这么多灰尘啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbf0d70ce98e1ee966a8c62993984e2e21e248901183cca3ab3c31d1ca01a103",
      "text": "好。首先，先把这个柜子上方给收拾干净吧。\n打扫的原则是从上到下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f085b87cb8d0a41f2e50257cc899c852d2f63c82d87428e5868e0600f25b2ebc",
      "text": "我明白了。\n柜子的清洁就交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49ac83d048ab320e8738c83eb5ec5330baa247da7f4e8e748292e23d60d0192b",
      "text": "拜托啦。那我从这附近开始吧。\n……嚯，比想象中要干净嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0891d9098e74b01f4d95794bfc02a32cf0b4fdfd08de406f0bb44a9bc7755971",
      "text": "这个事务所的气场之所以这么干净，也是因为有你和\n山村在守护着这里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:659b2cdc039de9b23f737c1b1d362608af2f4f93eb1dfd300b791fc735a57c04",
      "text": "没、没有做那么了不起的事啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc435e0d4fbcf59f6e82b66315f975f8a86999c4f406dcaf58713d16333ec52b",
      "text": "确实因为人多容易变乱，\n所以经常会勤快地打扫就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73d6034c5a09f8ceb0cc4e274d68ead41e96dcd67a58a921bcf59db8a70e3cc8",
      "text": "哈哈，是吗。\n那这里就交给轻车熟路的你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2197e55872d1e0124e30abd971011c97d8efbf5d40595cffd88d1a2f89d3ecf7",
      "text": "我去打扫别的地方。\n稍微感觉到了一点在意的污秽呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af78e6406206cae72f88b0c71910dddf6e6af6de7eed6ab2b3a2397e80661f82",
      "text": "好的，拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6fc4699fad862ab9b4b88060eb6259749f82b23dbddfcfec2433a4a5732d8d5",
      "text": "这里的污秽是……原来如此。\n是谁从外面带进来的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa7047276efe90ada3dca64746ee3cc1ade44ca5b72c905a8c0f91e150777d6a",
      "text": "（污垢积聚，气场就会浑浊。\n气场浑浊，就会引发纷争……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e53d181dc4823d9ab5b1fc91ec353ee8cc20d88eb203e5b4fd65e9f19eec413c",
      "text": "（可以的话，我可不想在这间事务所里\n看到那种东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12df52a56e8ef9d38d6045b54d35ed55d405765050f0081cbd471a3f7559ed0d",
      "text": "（对这个地方，我心怀收留我的恩情。\n得好好报答才行啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ba814116b31b315deedb52b06409d44fe07bc5779f63b765bab6e345fe34f8",
      "text": "那么……清扫时间到了。\n首先，就来听听你的说法吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000063:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b04fbc202ea69cad8a777e9211d23fa6b036d6a3ff58bac11fac9f38a8a1189b",
      "text": "雨彦先生，柜子打扫完了。\n哇，走廊变得好干净啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:591c2bd2423fb47c70141ee4e49c23ad6297d1d4c45f102ad2c9f7a439741f0c",
      "text": "能变得这么干净，太厉害了！\n而且……总觉得空气都变得神清气爽了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32021766f6a0f0975d28b79f6196e6c2bd8aff4ac042e32106476fa0f496800d",
      "text": "就算事务所里很干净，到外面工作的话\n总归还是会把脏东西带进来的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652a5ea55e61a8acb66cbd974b64f7b18d323aa54c0d15d5083114237f8f0e22",
      "text": "确实……下雨天之类的，也会被淋湿弄脏呢。\n我来想想看有什么对策。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8fc2654d7c59b8d0ab0992f46d441954a1b79c2ba983020798bc3bc8b53673",
      "text": "哈哈。嘛，脏了就脏了吧。\n像这样马上打扫干净就好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b7cdcd21b8be083ba139412a9e9159cc5802f0dd88a7e38437c416466e8ee3a",
      "text": "……好，这样就算告一段落了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f022dbb9bd776e481b0fcb4f251184588c827625f78ffb1e0ad911547dc6125",
      "text": "事务所的里里外外都变干净了呢。\n想乐先生和克里斯先生肯定也会大吃一惊吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:072a036c5dd093e751c251cd181a7f97b4fe6915b82e425892105a14cfba3eb3",
      "text": "期待他们两个的反应啊。一边喝着山村泡的\n茶，一边悠闲地等他们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a125be62052909b12f8842da5982556a440b4aabed2082074a395202e2edf8d1",
      "text": "嗯，好呀。\n……雨彦先生，今天非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72d487d20f32e45fe57976b482a6511e0aa82d94ac69337105937c7841cb0a2a",
      "text": "我今天也很感谢你哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11ababb52b042f599adfb45db8b5f27b3280ee2e8f45b5c08854db371adc585d",
      "text": "你不是帮我一起打扫了吗。\n多亏了你，比平时快了好多就搞定了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a486effd654597f78344e4445f2c4f38195548c976d84c1d41e9e77d4b71bba",
      "text": "能帮上一点小忙就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e599294e41e34b019b04f571e43f2decac9006093ad2b069b56b5f2b6923b4",
      "text": "比我预想的时间还要早结束呢。\n可不仅是一点小忙的程度哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d68d716b9bbd9ba6db6d1fec74a51c9f5aea8669948027a6666bea158a643fed",
      "text": "下次要是你有空的话，我再叫你。\n到时候也拜托啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
